note aienux/crates/aienos-artifact-tool/artifact_tool.om: Pure-Omega Binary Artifact v0
note and Admission Receipt v0 qualification tool (pack, inspect, id, sign, verify,
note negative-corpus H01..H29, receipt inspect/check/from-hex/sign-test/verify, CLI dispatch).
note Converted from aienux crates/aienos-artifact-tool/src/{main,corpus,receipt_cmd}.rs
note and crates/aienos-artifact/src/{format,capability,resource,canonical,id,signature,verify,receipt}.rs.
note Compose with: si/directives/om2.om om/tls/sha2.om aienux/crates/aienos-artifact-tool/artifact_tool.om ...

